# Plan M9, step 3 (the author, 2026-11-10; the book, receiver-args-only): in the body of a named Structure `i: int: 5`
# declares no field i of an int: it is a nested Structure i with the receiver's application inside, which the lowering
# does not build yet -- refused at the application.  The field is declared `int: i 5`.
Holder:
    i: int: 5
end: Holder
send: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
